    <dashboard name='2 Credit Risk Segmentation'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>Credit Risk Segmentation</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='wrap' value='on' />
          <format attr='font-family' value='Tableau Book' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1020' maxwidth='1600' minheight='1020' minwidth='1600' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='1' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='5294' id='2' type-v2='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='980'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>Credit Risk &amp; Loan Default Analysis  ·  Credit Risk Segmentation</run>
              <run fontcolor='#d7dee8' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>
Which grades, purposes, terms, incomes and DTI bands drive observed default</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='padding' value='14' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#1b365d' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='10588' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='7059'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  60-month loans default at 32.5% versus 16.0% for 36-month loans.</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;EVIDENCE</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Small business purpose defaults at 29.9%; DTI above 30% defaults at 29.2%.</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;BUSINESS MEANING</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Term and purpose remain strong risk differentiators after grade.</run>
