          <zone h='10588' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='7059'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Grade C contributes the largest expected-loss dollars ($608M base case).</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;EVIDENCE</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Grade D expected loss is 15.2% of exposure; debt consolidation dominates purpose-level EL.</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;BUSINESS MEANING</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  PD × exposure × expected loss should drive management focus.</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b365d' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='9'>&#10;RECOMMENDED ACTION</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1c2430' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>  Set an expected-loss appetite for high-dollar segments.</run>
